ILANG
[TYPE:config][PROJECT:mealkitdeals][LANG:zh]

::STATE{@SITE, brand:mealkitdeals, niche:meal delivery / meal kit deals, locale:en-US, currency:USD, domain:mealkitdeals.com}

::MODULE{PROVIDERS|title:抓哪几家 这里改了站就变}
  HelloFresh | hellofresh.com | https://www.hellofresh.com/eat/coupon-codes-and-promotions | https://blog.hellofresh.com/ | https://www.hellofresh.com/robots.txt
  Blue Apron | blueapron.com | https://blog.blueapron.com/ | https://www.blueapron.com/robots.txt
  Home Chef | homechef.com | https://www.homechef.com/ | https://www.homechef.com/robots.txt
  Factor | factor75.com | https://www.factor75.com/faq | https://www.factor75.com/ | https://www.factor75.com/robots.txt
  Marley Spoon | marleyspoon.com | https://marleyspoon.com/ | https://marleyspoon.com/robots.txt
  Hungryroot | hungryroot.com | https://www.hungryroot.com/ | https://www.hungryroot.com/robots.txt
  CookUnity | cookunity.com | https://www.cookunity.com/lp/cookunity-discount-code | https://www.cookunity.com/ | https://www.cookunity.com/robots.txt
  Thistle | thistle.co | https://try.thistle.co/specialty_discounts/ | https://www.thistle.co/ | https://www.thistle.co/robots.txt
  Gobble | gobble.com | https://www.gobble.com/quickmeals-menu/ | https://www.gobble.com/spring-menu4/ | https://www.gobble.com/robots.txt

::MODULE{FIELDS|title:每条优惠提取什么}
  title price currency offer_url valid_until source_url fetched_at status

::MODULE{RENDER|title:页面渲染规则}
  pages: index provider deal compare
  update_cron: every_6_hours
  language: en-US
  affiliate_note: Links may be affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. Commissions follow each network's public terms.

::MODULE{AFFILIATE|title:正规联盟出口位 先放官方入口 有联盟号再替换}
  HelloFresh | https://www.hellofresh.com/plans
  Blue Apron | https://www.blueapron.com/
  Home Chef | https://www.homechef.com/
  Factor | https://www.factor75.com/
  Marley Spoon | https://marleyspoon.com/
  Hungryroot | https://www.hungryroot.com/
  CookUnity | https://www.cookunity.com/
  Thistle | https://www.thistle.co/
  Gobble | https://www.gobble.com/

::RULE{抓不到 price⇒这条不写 price 字段 也不写进结构化数据 不许拿估的填}
::RULE{valid_until 已过⇒标记过期或下架 不许留着冒充有效}
::RULE{运行时零推理 零API密钥 纯Python}
::BOUNDARY{never:编优惠 编价格 编佣金|scope:permanent}
